# One line ending on every computer: LF in the repository and in each checkout, Windows included, whatever
# core.autocrlf says. The shell scripts run under Git Bash, and a file reads and hashes the same on a Mac and a PC.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touched as text.
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
*.safetensors binary
*.onnx binary
